{"seq":1,"slug":"data-fetching-cache","title":"数据获取与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-management/server-state/data-fetching-cache","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据获取与缓存\">数据获取与缓存</h1><p>「发个请求,把数据存进 state,渲染出来」——几乎每个前端新手都这么写过,然后很快发现要补加载态、补错误态、补重复请求去重、补离开页面再回来的重新获取、补缓存过期……补到最后,你手写了半个 TanStack Query。服务端数据获取之所以远比想象复杂,是因为你拿到的数据从拿到那一刻起就在变旧,而管理「旧数据何时该刷新」是一套高度通用、值得沉淀成库的机制。这一篇讲清这套机制的原理,以及 2026 年的主流库如何把它声明式化。它是 <a href=\"./\">服务端状态</a>三篇里的地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务端状态的读取有一条固定生命周期:首次获取 → 缓存 → 标记为陈旧(stale) → 在合适时机后台重取 → 用新数据更新缓存。专门的查询库把这条生命周期封装成一个由「缓存键」索引的声明式查询,你只描述「我要哪份数据」,何时取、何时缓存、何时刷新由库决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[组件声明 useQuery key+fetcher] --&gt; B{缓存命中?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[发请求· 显示 loading]&#10;  B --&gt;|是且新鲜| D[直接返回缓存]&#10;  B --&gt;|是但陈旧| E[先返回陈旧数据· 后台重取]&#10;  C --&gt; F[写入缓存]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[新数据· 通知订阅组件]\">flowchart TD\n  A[组件声明 useQuery key+fetcher] --&gt; B{缓存命中?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[发请求· 显示 loading]\n  B --&gt;|是且新鲜| D[直接返回缓存]\n  B --&gt;|是但陈旧| E[先返回陈旧数据· 后台重取]\n  C --&gt; F[写入缓存]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[新数据· 通知订阅组件]</pre><p>2026 年三大主流库各有定位,选型从这张表起步。三者解决的是同一类问题,差别在体量与生态绑定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>体量</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TanStack Query</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>功能最全,生态最大,周下载约 1200 万</td>\n<td>复杂应用、需 DevTools 与精细缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SWR</td>\n<td>约 4KB</td>\n<td>Vercel 出品,轻量,Next 友好</td>\n<td>简单获取、看重体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTK Query</td>\n<td>内置于 RTK</td>\n<td>已用 Redux 且需归一化缓存</td>\n<td>既有 Redux 投入的项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>(来源:<a href=\"https://byteiota.com/tanstack-2026-full-stack-revolution-with-query-router/\">byteiota</a>、<a href=\"https://trybuildpilot.com/842-react-query-vs-swr-vs-rtk-query-2026\">trybuildpilot</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.bswen.com/blog/2026-03-03-react-data-fetching-libraries-comparison/\">BSWEN</a>)</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么服务端状态需要专门工具\">为什么服务端状态需要专门工具</h2><p>把服务端数据塞进 Redux 或 Zustand 手动管理,你会被迫一遍遍重写同一套样板:<code>isLoading</code>、<code>error</code>、<code>data</code> 三件套,组件卸载后再回来要不要重新请求,两个组件同时请求同一份数据要不要去重,数据多久算过期。这些需求对每一份远程数据都一样,且与具体业务无关——这正是「应该沉淀成库」的信号。</p>\n<p>更深一层的原因在 <a href=\"../foundations/state-categories\">状态分类与挑战</a>里已点明:服务端状态的真相源在后端,你的副本注定会过期,所以管理它的本质不是「存储」而是「与远端保持适度同步」。这是一个缓存问题,而非状态存储问题。把它当普通全局状态存,等于用错了工具去解一类缓存问题——这也是 2026 年「Redux 不再管服务端状态」共识的根源(见 <a href=\"../patterns/flux-redux\">Flux 与 Redux 单向数据流</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stale-while-revalidate-先给旧的-再换新的\">stale-while-revalidate:先给旧的,再换新的</h2><p>现代查询库的缓存灵魂是 stale-while-revalidate(SWR,陈旧时重新验证)策略,SWR 库的名字就来自它。它的逻辑是:缓存里有数据就立刻把(可能已陈旧的)数据返回给用户,界面瞬间出内容、零等待;与此同时在后台静默发起重取,新数据回来后再无缝替换。用户几乎永远不必盯着空白加载态,数据又能保持新鲜。</p>\n<p>这背后是「新鲜度」与「陈旧度」两个时间维度的配置。设某次数据写入缓存的时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,新鲜期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{stale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,则在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 该数据被判定为陈旧当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t - t_0 &gt; T_{\\text{stale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。陈旧不等于无用——陈旧数据照样先展示,只是会触发后台重取。另一个维度是垃圾回收时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{gc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:无组件订阅某缓存超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{gc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后,该缓存才被真正清除。调好这两个参数,是用好查询库的核心手艺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存键-查询缓存的寻址方式\">缓存键:查询缓存的寻址方式</h2><p>查询库用「缓存键」(query key)给每一份缓存寻址,这是整个系统的索引。在 TanStack Query 里键是一个数组,比如 <code>[&#39;todos&#39;, { status: &#39;done&#39;, page: 2 }]</code>——库把这个键序列化后作为缓存的唯一标识。键相同的查询共享同一份缓存并自动去重;键不同则各自独立缓存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { useQuery } from &#39;@tanstack/react-query&#39;;&#10;&#10;function Todos({ status, page }) {&#10;  const { data, isLoading, isError } = useQuery({&#10;    queryKey: [&#39;todos&#39;, { status, page }], // 键随筛选条件变化&#10;    queryFn: () =&gt; fetch(`/api/todos?status=${status}&amp;page=${page}`).then((r) =&gt; r.json()),&#10;    staleTime: 30_000, // 30 秒内视为新鲜,不后台重取&#10;  });&#10;  if (isLoading) return &lt;Spinner /&gt;;&#10;  if (isError) return &lt;Error /&gt;;&#10;  return &lt;List items={data} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useQuery } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@tanstack/react-query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Todos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'todos'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { status, page }], </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 键随筛选条件变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/todos?status=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}&#x26;page=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">page</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    staleTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 30 秒内视为新鲜,不后台重取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isLoading) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Spinner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isError) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">List</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{data} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>缓存键的设计直接决定缓存行为:把所有影响数据的参数都放进键,筛选条件一变键就变,库自动当成一份新查询去取并缓存;反之若漏放某个参数,不同条件就会错误地共用缓存。键的设计还和归一化、跨查询更新紧密相关,这部分留给 <a href=\"normalization-sync\">归一化与实时同步</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动重取与请求去重-省心机制背后的逻辑\">自动重取与请求去重:省心机制背后的逻辑</h2><p>查询库默认在几个时机自动重取陈旧数据:窗口重新聚焦(用户切回标签页)、网络重连、组件重新挂载。这套默认行为的意图是「用户回来看的总是较新的数据」,而它之所以不扰民,正是因为有 SWR 兜底——重取期间旧数据照常展示。这些时机都可按查询关闭或调整。</p>\n<p>请求去重是另一个省心机制:同一时刻多个组件请求同一个缓存键,库只发一个真实请求,结果分发给所有订阅者。这让你可以放心地在任意组件里直接 <code>useQuery</code> 同一份数据,不必把它提升到顶层再透传——服务端状态的「共享」由缓存键天然完成,无需走 <a href=\"../foundations/local-vs-global\">局部与全局状态</a>那套客户端状态的提升逻辑。这是服务端状态层最被低估的好处之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>服务端数据有固定生命周期:获取→缓存→陈旧→后台重取→更新,这套机制高度通用,值得沉淀成查询库。</li>\n<li>服务端状态本质是缓存问题而非存储问题,真相源在后端、副本注定过期,所以不该用 Redux/Zustand 手搓。</li>\n<li>stale-while-revalidate 是缓存灵魂:先返回陈旧数据保证零等待,后台静默重取保证新鲜,靠新鲜期与 GC 期两参数调控。</li>\n<li>缓存键给每份缓存寻址,把所有影响数据的参数放进键,键相同自动共享去重、键不同各自缓存。</li>\n<li>自动重取(聚焦/重连/重挂)与请求去重让服务端状态共享变得零成本,组件可就地获取,无需提升透传。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据获取与缓存","id":"数据获取与缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么服务端状态需要专门工具","id":"为什么服务端状态需要专门工具"},{"level":2,"text":"stale-while-revalidate:先给旧的,再换新的","id":"stale-while-revalidate-先给旧的-再换新的"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存键:查询缓存的寻址方式","id":"缓存键-查询缓存的寻址方式"},{"level":2,"text":"自动重取与请求去重:省心机制背后的逻辑","id":"自动重取与请求去重-省心机制背后的逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信号与细粒度响应式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-management/patterns/signals-fine-grained"},"next":{"title":"异步与乐观更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-management/server-state/async-mutations"}}